{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْعَادِيَاتِ","d":"wal-ʿādiyāti","e":"By the racers"},{"c":"ضَبْحًا","d":"ḍabḥan","e":"panting"}],"a":{"g":"By the racers, panting,"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْمُورِيَاتِ","d":"fal-mūriyāti","e":"And the producers of sparks"},{"c":"قَدْحًا","d":"qadḥan","e":"striking"}],"a":{"g":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْمُغِيرَاتِ","d":"fal-mughīrāti","e":"And the chargers"},{"c":"صُبْحًا","d":"ṣub'ḥan","e":"(at) dawn"}],"a":{"g":"And the chargers at dawn,"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَثَرْنَ","d":"fa-atharna","e":"Then raise"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"thereby"},{"c":"نَقْعًا","d":"naqʿan","e":"dust"}],"a":{"g":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust,"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فَوَسَطْنَ","d":"fawasaṭna","e":"Then penetrate (in the) center"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"thereby"},{"c":"جَمْعًا","d":"jamʿan","e":"(of) troops"}],"a":{"g":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively,"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانَ","d":"l-insāna","e":"mankind"},{"c":"لِرَبِّهِ","d":"lirabbihi","e":"to his Lord"},{"c":"لَكَنُودٌ","d":"lakanūdun","e":"(is) surely ungrateful"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّهُ","d":"wa-innahu","e":"And indeed he"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَشَهِيدٌ","d":"lashahīdun","e":"surely (is) a witness"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, he is to that a witness."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّهُ","d":"wa-innahu","e":"And indeed he (is)"},{"c":"لِحُبِّ","d":"liḥubbi","e":"in (the) love"},{"c":"الْخَيْرِ","d":"l-khayri","e":"(of) wealth"},{"c":"لَشَدِيدٌ","d":"lashadīdun","e":"(is) surely intense"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَلَا","d":"afalā","e":"But does not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُ","d":"yaʿlamu","e":"he know"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"بُعْثِرَ","d":"buʿ'thira","e":"will be scattered"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"الْقُبُورِ","d":"l-qubūri","e":"the graves"}],"a":{"g":"But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَحُصِّلَ","d":"waḥuṣṣila","e":"And is made apparent"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"الصُّدُورِ","d":"l-ṣudūri","e":"the breasts"}],"a":{"g":"And that within the breasts is obtained,"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"رَبَّهُمْ","d":"rabbahum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"بِهِمْ","d":"bihim","e":"about them"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لَخَبِيرٌ","d":"lakhabīrun","e":"(is) surely All-Aware"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Acquainted."}}}